### KAPJ Flow — Hospital Service REST Client Collection
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@serviceKey = kapj_service_key_for_testing_1234567890_min32

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login Petugas RS (Siti Rahmawati)
# @name loginHospital
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "siti.rahmawati@rs-jantung.co.id",
  "password": "KasirRS#2025"
}

### Simpan token dari respons di atas
@authToken = {{loginHospital.response.body.data.access_token}}

### 3. Get Profil Petugas RS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get System Config
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/config
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Toggle Simulation Mode (COB)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/system/simulation-mode
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "simulation_mode": "COB",
  "default_split_preset": "ARBITRARY_COB_30_58_12"
}

### 6. Summary Pasien
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. List Pasien
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Detail Pasien (ID 1 - Aulia Ramadhani)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. List Kasus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases?tab=ALL
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Detail Kasus (ID 1 - KAS-2026-001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Cek Kelengkapan Dokumen Kasus 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Hitung Simulasi Split Bill (Arbitrary 30% / 58% / 12%)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/1/split-bill/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preset_name": "Simulasi CoB Standar (30% BPJS / 58% Swasta / 12% Pasien)",
  "split_method": "PERCENTAGE",
  "bpjs_percent": 30.0,
  "insurer_percent": 58.0,
  "patient_percent": 12.0
}

### 13. Terapkan Simulasi Split Bill (Apply)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/1/split-bill/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. [T-201] Dispatch Pengajuan Subklaim ke BPJS & Asuransi Swasta
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/1/subclaims/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 15. [T-201] Kirim Ulang Subklaim Pasca Revisi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/1/subclaims/1/resubmit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Berkas resume medis dan BHP telah diperbarui"
}

### 16. [T-206] Kirim Pesan / Klarifikasi ke Penjamin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subclaim_id": 1,
  "message": "Mohon konfirmasi verifikasi SEP dan resume medis digital pasien."
}

### 17. [T-206] List Notifikasi RS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 18. [T-206] Tandai Notifikasi Dibaca
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 19. [T-304] Dashboard Operasional RS Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 20. [T-304] Panel Prioritas Perlu Tindak Lanjut
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/action-required
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 21. [T-304] Feed Aktivitas RS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 22. Get Invoice Kasus 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/1/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 23. Catat Pembayaran BPJS (Rp 37.500.000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payer_source": "BPJS",
  "subclaim_id": 1,
  "payment_method": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "amount": 37500000,
  "bank_reference": "TRF-BPJS-9018237"
}

### 24. Rekap Finansial & Rekonsiliasi Bank
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
